title Hands inside the box
intro Red is attacking your goal.

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-LF at 32, 32.6
  ball with R-LF

step
  caption Red has the ball near your goal.
  draw penalty-area left

step
  caption Red shoots — and the goalie catches it with their hands!
  B-G to 9.5, 34
  ball with B-G
  hands B-G
  label B-G Catch
  arrow from R-LF to ball
  draw penalty-area left
  banner Catch
  duration 1300

question
  prompt Can the goalie use their hands here?
  answer Yes
  wrong No
  wrong Only outside the box
  wrong Only after a goal
  correct Hands are fine in the box.
  why The goalie is inside their own penalty area, so they may catch the ball.

question
  prompt After the catch, what can they do?
  answer Throw or kick it out
  wrong Run holding the ball
  wrong Give it to Red
  wrong Take a corner
  correct Throw it or kick it out.
  why After a catch, the goalie can throw it or drop it and kick it. They cannot run the whole field holding it.

step
  caption The goalie has the ball in their hands.
  label B-G Throw
  draw penalty-area left

step
  caption They throw it out to a teammate. Play goes on!
  B-LB to 29.4, 23.1
  ball with B-LB
  arrow from B-G to ball
  draw penalty-area left
  banner Throw out
  duration 1200
